{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"36756","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v50140","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"さいとうつかさ","creatorId":"vndb:s2482","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:327","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2482","name":"さいとうつかさ","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:281413","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"ティータ.J(椿T太、湊みなも)","creatorId":"vndb:s1835","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:5033","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1835","name":"ティータ.J(椿T太、湊みなも)","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:281414","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"の歯","creatorId":"vndb:s4279","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:17731","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4279","name":"の歯","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:281415","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"あかつき聖","creatorId":"vndb:s18516","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:33920","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s18516","name":"あかつき聖","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:281416","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"須々木 鮎尾","creatorId":"vndb:s2319","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2319","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2319","name":"須々木 鮎尾","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:205620","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"結城","creatorId":"vndb:s4271","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4271","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4271","name":"結城","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:205623","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"利波 創造","creatorId":"vndb:s4272","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4272","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4272","name":"利波 創造","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:205624","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"森野 いづみ","creatorId":"vndb:s13638","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s13638","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s13638","name":"森野 いづみ","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:205626","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"やなぎ いろ","creatorId":"vndb:s26076","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s26076","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s26076","name":"やなぎ いろ","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:205628","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"百日紅 こあ","creatorId":"vndb:s26077","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s26077","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s26077","name":"百日紅こあ","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:205629","source":"vndb"}],"music":[],"other":[{"creditedName":"乃美 糸","creatorId":"vndb:s2929","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2929","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2929","name":"乃美 糸","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:205622","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c137816","characterName":"矢神 翼咲","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"155197","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"489593"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27817"],"vndbCharacterId":"c137816"},"originalCharacterName":"矢神 翼咲","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A second-year student."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Unlike her calm older sister, she has a lively personality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"If anything, she is the type to think after she acts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she is not so good at studying, she has excellent athletic ability and is also skillful. She has good instincts and can quickly become average at most sports."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It's not that she can't study, but if she works hard, her grades improve."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"On the other hand, if she doesn't work hard, she won't improve, so her grades fluctuate greatly depending on her mood at the time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has an extraordinary ability to concentrate, but once she does, she sometimes loses sight of what's going on around her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When her older sister Sawa goes missing, she tries all sorts of things to find her, but there's no progress, so as a last resort, she decides to disguise herself as a boy and transfer to the boys' school where Sawa worked."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At her new school, she calls herself \"Yagawa Tsubasa.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a lot of trust in her childhood friend, Satoshi, and when she has any problems, she is the first person she consults."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her parents died in an accident several years ago, and her only relative is her older sister Sawa."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her parents left her a large inheritance, so she never had to worry about anything financially."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c137816"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"２年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりした姉とは反対で、活発な性格をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どちらかといえば、動いてから考えるタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勉強はそこまで得意ではないけれども、運動神経はバツグンで、器用でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勘が良く、大抵のスポーツはすぐに人並みにできるくらいになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勉強もできないわけではなく、頑張れば頑張った分だけ成績が伸びる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"反面、頑張らないと伸びないので、その時の気分で成績には大きく波がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"集中力が並外れているのだが、いったん集中すると周りが見えなくなる所がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉の紗羽が音信不通になり、捜索にいろいろと手を尽くすも進展がなく、最終手段として、自ら男子に変装して紗羽が勤めていた男子校に転入することにした。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"転入先では「矢川翼（やがわ つばさ）」と名乗る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼なじみの惺には大きな信頼を置いていて、何か困った事があると、真っ先に相談するのは彼女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親は数年前に事故で亡くなっており、親類は姉の紗羽のみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親が多額の遺産を残してくれたため、その後も経済的に不自由はなかった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27817","sourceWorkId":"36241","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"2年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりした姉とは反対で、活発な性格をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どちらかといえば、動いてから考えるタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勉強はそこまで得意ではないけれども、運動神経はバツグンで、器用でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勘が良く、大抵のスポーツはすぐに人並みにできるくらいになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勉強もできないわけではなく、頑張れば頑張った分だけ成績が伸びる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"反面、頑張らないと伸びないので、その時の気分で成績には大きく波がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"集中力が並外れているのだが、いったん集中すると周りが見えなくなる所がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉の紗羽が音信不通になり、捜索にいろいろと手を尽くすも"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"進展がなく、最終手段として、自ら男子に変装して"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"紗羽が勤めていた男子校に転入することにした。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"転入先では「矢川翼(やがわつばさ)」と名乗る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼なじみの惺には大きな信頼を置いていて、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何か困った事があると、真っ先に相談するのは彼女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親は数年前に事故で亡くなっており、親類は姉の紗羽のみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親が多額の遺産を残してくれたため、その後も経済的に不自由はなかった。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"155197"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a2/a27fe9654ab59e1a54c6440309f9cec505385f218bfc04463e8dac942b3baeab.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d9/d95071aaa57cc7ea223476f1abb04bfe41a22c99c64bf2ad64d5a9dc8ae7a18d.webp","width":193,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ふじたまみ","creatorId":"vndb:s7951","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7951","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7951","name":"ふじた まみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:489593:155197:23302:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"砂糖 ここのつ","creatorId":"vndb:s11591","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11591","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11591","name":"八ッ橋しなもん(朔白)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:97613","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c137817","characterName":"矢神 紗羽","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"155212","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"489593"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27818"],"vndbCharacterId":"c137817"},"originalCharacterName":"矢神 紗羽","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A Japanese language teacher."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tsubasa Saki's older sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has loved reading since she was young, and this led her to choose the path of a Japanese language teacher."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Unlike Tsubasa, she is not good at sports overall, but she is good at studying and is consistent. When it comes to studying, she is a quick learner and always had high grades."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While she was in school, people around her told her that she could pursue many different career paths, but her goal was to become a teacher, and she achieved that goal."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is very gentle and does not like conflict."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She cannot leave people in trouble alone, and is willing to get hurt in order to help others, so everyone is often worried about her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a side to her that makes her not good at turning down requests, but once she makes up her mind, she has the strength to see it through to the end."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c137817"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"国語教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"翼咲の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼いころから読書好きで、それが高じて国語教師の道を選ぶ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"翼咲とは逆で運動は全体的に苦手だが、勉強は波がなく得意なタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勉強に関してはとにかく飲み込みが早く、成績は常に上位だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在学中は周りから「いろいろな進路を目指せるぞ」と言われていたのだが、教師になるのが目標だったので、その目標を叶えた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"非常におっとりしていて、争いは好まない性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"困っている人を放っておけず、人を助けるためなら自分が傷つくのも厭わない所があり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"みんなによく心配されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頼み事を断るのが苦手といったような一面もあるけれども、一度決めた事は最後まで貫き通す強さを持っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27818","sourceWorkId":"36241","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"国語教師で翼咲の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼いころから読書好きで、それが高じて国語教師の道を選ぶ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"翼咲とは逆で運動は全体的に苦手だが、勉強は波がなく得意なタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勉強に関してはとにかく飲み込みが早く、成績は常に上位だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在学中は周りから「いろいろな進路を目指せるぞ」と言われていたのだが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教師になるのが目標だったので、その目標を叶えた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"非常におっとりしていて、争いは好まない性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"困っている人を放っておけず、人を助けるためなら"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分が傷つくのも厭わない所があり、みんなによく心配されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頼み事を断るのが苦手といったような一面もあるけれども、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一度決めた事は最後まで貫き通す強さを持っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"155212"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b0/b0431eb663025f72013f47abde77ccf62cd81a256725cf6b1934487c59d9e657.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d7/d75983df9e41ca732d9c861176888a39f167d47ffc3ca52a2a86811ac47c14d7.webp","width":193,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"角無まるみ","creatorId":"vndb:s37482","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s37482","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s37482","name":"角無 まるみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:489593:155212:63899:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c137818","characterName":"卜部 甘那","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"155213","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"489593"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27819"],"vndbCharacterId":"c137818"},"originalCharacterName":"卜部 甘那","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An art teacher."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was Sawa's classmate and best friend in college."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she is an art teacher, she is actually good at sports in general, and was even a member of the national team for swimming."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, she retired from swimming because she wanted to do other things besides sports."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the type of person who will try anything that interests her first, and has experience with a variety of martial arts. She is skilled enough in judo and karate to compete with athletes with ranks."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is an avid reader, and is an omnivore who reads a wide range of books, from manga to foreign literature."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Recently, she has been fond of classic mysteries and hardcore shoujo manga."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She and Sawa have quite opposite personalities, but they hit it off because they both love books."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has also met Tsubasa and Satoshi through Sawa."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c137818"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"美術教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"紗羽とは大学の同級生で、親友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美術教師だがスポーツ全般も実は得意で、水泳で代表強化選手になったこともある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、スポーツ以外にやりたいことがあったので選手は引退した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"興味のあることはまず試してみる性格で、格闘技などもいろいろ経験している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柔道・空手などは段持ちの選手と渡り合えるほどの実力を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"読書家で、マンガから海外文学まで幅広く手をつける雑食派。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近は古典のミステリーやコテコテの少女マンガが好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"紗羽とはわりと正反対の性格だが、お互いに本好きな所から意気投合した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"紗羽を通じて翼咲や惺とも会ったこともある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27819","sourceWorkId":"36241","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"美術教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"紗羽とは大学の同級生で、親友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美術教師だがスポーツ全般も実は得意で、水泳で代表強化選手になったこともある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、スポーツ以外にやりたいことがあったので選手は引退した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"興味のあることはまず試してみる性格で、格闘技などもいろいろ経験している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柔道·空手などは段持ちの選手と渡り合えるほどの実力を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"読書家で、マンガから海外文学まで幅広く手をつける雑食派。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近は古典のミステリーやコテコテの少女マンガが好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"紗羽とはわりと正反対の性格だが、お互いに本好きな所から意気投合した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"紗羽を通じて翼咲や惺とも会ったこともある。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"155213"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4be2c9034864e2c18dc8e930a98112441b25e17f253eee59ec71618a9987d7e6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0b/0bb3dd28f0e230f4cc5b07201dd1395af1e96c031300179facb87d54c6e9bd1b.webp","width":193,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"一ノ瀬 あき","creatorId":"vndb:s37483","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s37483","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s37483","name":"一ノ瀬 あき","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:97615","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c137819","characterName":"水守 惺","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"155214","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"489593"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27820"],"vndbCharacterId":"c137819"},"originalCharacterName":"水守 惺","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A second-year student."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She used to be childhood friends with sisters Tsubasa and Sawa and lived nearby. She"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"has now left home and lives alone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she has a somewhat twisted personality, she got along well with Tsubasa and Sawa since they were young, and they often spent time together."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her father is an executive at a famous company, and her family is quite wealthy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She attends a correspondence school, and usually doesn't leave the house."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She doesn't get along well with her parents (especially her mother)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was fed up with her mother, who was a so-called \"educational mom,\" and started living alone early on."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"(She only got her to agree to living alone on the condition that she enter the top school her mother wanted.)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she receives financial support, she doesn't touch the money."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She makes and streams videos, and earns enough to cover the costs of living alone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a lot of illegal knowledge from information she has obtained from the internet."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c137819"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"２年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"翼咲・紗羽の姉妹とは元々は近所に住んでいた幼なじみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今は家を出て一人暮らしをしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ややひねくれた性格をしているが、翼咲や紗羽とは小さい頃からウマが合い、一緒にいることが多かった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父は有名企業の重役で、家はかなり裕福。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"通信系の学園に入っていて、普段はほとんど家から出ない生活をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親（特に母親）と仲が良くない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いわゆる「教育ママ」の母親に嫌気が差し、早々に一人暮らしを始めた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"（母の希望する一流と呼ばれる学園に入学することを条件に、一人暮らしを認めさせた）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"金銭的な援助はしてもらっているものの、その金には手をつけていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"動画製作や配信をしていて、一人暮らしの生活費をまかなえるくらいは稼いでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ネットから得た情報で、いろいろと非合法な知識も多く持っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27820","sourceWorkId":"36241","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"2年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"翼咲·紗羽の姉妹とは元々は近所に住んでいた幼なじみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今は家を出て一人暮らしをしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ややひねくれた性格をしているが、翼咲や紗羽とは小さい頃からウマが合い、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一緒にいる